     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">Hello Phil,</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">I estimated a correlated 5-dimensional model and got the\r\nfollowing messages. The model converged and I got the parameters and\r\neverything. But also got the following warnings. Are they serious? Can I ignore\r\nthem? The method was ‘QMCEM’.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">Warning messages:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">1: Log-likelihood was decreasing near the ML solution. EM method\r\nmay be unstable</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:107%\">2: Could not invert information\r\nmatrix; model may not be empirically identified.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:107%\">Best</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:107%\">Afshin</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt;line-height:107%;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:107%\"> </span></p><div><br></div><span class=\"gmail_signature_prefix\">-- </span><br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Afshin Khosravi, PhD TEFL, MA TEFL, </div></div></div>\r\n"
    ]
